 "description": "Approval events for one token over a short, bounded window, decoded to owner/spender/amount \u2014 the ledger of who just gave someone leave to move their USDC. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/approvals-scan?chain=base&token=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913&blocks=20.",
